  abstract    = "The Molecular Signatures Database (MSigDB) is one of the most
                 widely used and comprehensive databases of gene sets for
                 performing gene set enrichment analysis. Since its creation,
                 MSigDB has grown beyond its roots in metabolic disease and
                 cancer to include >10,000 gene sets. These better represent a
