               components. In vitro, VAT-conditioned media decreased hepatocyte
               and myotube insulin sensitivity, hepatocyte glucose handling,
               and increased basal activation of inflammatory signaling in
               myotubes compared with SAT. Depot-specific differences in
               adipose tissue secretome composition alter paracrine and
